@DocAgent.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5248

### Liveness
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness (includes the database)
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### ---- Auth (Identity API endpoints, bearer tokens) ----

### Register (sends a confirmation email; in dev read it in Mailpit's web UI, see the Aspire dashboard)
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!x" }

### Login: returns accessToken (1 h) and refreshToken (14 d)
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!x" }

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken); %}

### Refresh tokens
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Confirm email (use the link from the email)
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/confirmEmail?userId=<id>&code=<code>

### Resend confirmation email
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/resendConfirmationEmail
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com" }

### Forgot password (emails a reset code to confirmed addresses)
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/forgotPassword
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com" }

### Reset password with the emailed code
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/resetPassword
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "resetCode": "<code>", "newPassword": "N3wPassw0rd!" }

### ---- External sign-in (Google / GitHub) ----
# Open these in a browser, not here: they redirect to the provider. returnUrl must be on the allowlist
# (Authentication:External:AllowedReturnUrls). Easiest end-to-end try: /dev/external-login-test (Development only).

### Start Google sign-in (302 to accounts.google.com)
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/external/google?returnUrl=http://localhost:3000

### Start GitHub sign-in (302 to github.com)
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/external/github?returnUrl=http://localhost:3000

### Exchange the one-time code from the redirect (?code=...) for tokens (valid 60 s, single use)
POST {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/external/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "<code from returnUrl>" }

### Built-in external login test page (Development only)
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/dev/external-login-test

### ---- Current user ----

### Who am I
GET {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete my account and all my data (204)
DELETE {{DocAgent.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
